{"id":"bf3bde63-1675-4c11-9520-cc9682c3e63b","object":"chat.completion","created":1784276658,"model":"deepseek-v4-pro","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"index":0,"id":"call_00_fnYYcmelB5iIR210wTdg3799","type":"function","function":{"name":"Summary","arguments":"{\"summary\": \"Amazon Alexa is a virtual assistant technology developed by Amazon, first announced in November 2014 alongside the Echo smart speaker. It was largely built from two acquisitions: the British company Evi (founded by William Tunstall-Pedoe), which provided the question-to-answer system, and the Polish speech synthesizer Ivona, which provided text-to-speech capabilities. The name \\\"Alexa\\\" was chosen for its hard consonant 'X', aiding voice recognition precision, and is reminiscent of the Library of Alexandria.\\n\\nAlexa is available on multiple platforms including Fire OS, iOS, Android, Linux, Windows, and Wear OS, and supports languages including English, French, German, Japanese, Italian, Spanish, Portuguese, Hindi, and Arabic. It functions through natural language processing, enabling voice interaction, music playback, to-do lists, alarms, podcasts, audiobooks, weather, traffic, sports updates, news, and home automation control of smart devices. Third-party developers can extend Alexa's capabilities through \\\"skills\\\" (apps), with over 90,000 skills available as of April 2019.\\n\\nKey historical milestones: In 2015, Amazon launched the $200 million Alexa Fund to invest in voice technology companies. The Alexa Prize was announced in 2016. By January 2019, Amazon had sold over 100 million Alexa-enabled devices. However, hoped-for revenue from voice ordering never materialized; by 2022 the division was losing billions per quarter, leading to mass layoffs. In 2023, Amazon directed employees to train a large language model codenamed \\\"Olympus.\\\" In December 2024, Amazon announced its Nova brand of AI models. In February 2025, Amazon introduced Alexa+, powered by generative AI and free for Prime members, with Anthropic's Claude models integrated. In January 2026, Alexa+ expanded to the web via Alexa.com. By February 2026, Alexa+ became available to all U.S. users. Amazon also entered advanced discussions in early 2026 to invest up to $50 billion in OpenAI for potential AI partnership.\\n\\nAlexa features include: home automation with numerous manufacturers (Philips Hue, Nest, SmartThings, etc.); food ordering via Domino's, Grubhub, Pizza Hut, and others; music streaming from Amazon Music, Spotify, Apple Music, Pandora, and more; sports updates for 15 leagues; messaging and calling; Alexa for Business (paid subscription for conference calls, scheduling); and severe weather alerts and traffic updates (added February 2020). Amazon Lex, the underlying speech recognition and NLP technology, was made available to developers in November 2016 to build conversational chatbots. The Alexa Voice Service (AVS) allows third-party manufacturers to integrate Alexa into their products at no cost.\", \"key_excerpts\": \"Amazon developers chose the name Alexa because it has a hard consonant with the X, which helps it be recognized with higher precision. They have said the name is reminiscent of the Library of Alexandria., As of November 2018, more than 10,000 Amazon employees worked on Alexa and related products. In January 2019, Amazon's devices team announced that they had sold over 100 million Alexa-enabled devices., In 2022, with the division losing several billion dollars per quarter, the company started laying off Alexa employees en masse., In February 2025, Amazon introduced Alexa+, the latest version of their voice assistant, which is powered by generative AI. Alexa+ was announced to be free for all Prime members., In early 2026, Amazon entered advanced discussions to invest up to $50 billion in OpenAI as part of a potential artificial intelligence partnership so that OpenAI's models could be integrated into Amazon's digital assistant Alexa and other internal projects.\"}"}}]},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"tool_calls"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":5509,"completion_tokens":807,"total_tokens":6316,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":5504},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":5504,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":5},"system_fingerprint":"fp_9954b31ca7_prod0820_fp8_kvcache_20260402"}